---
// src/components/layout/AboutSection.astro
---
<section id="about" class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 border-l border-r border-b border-workbench-border">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col items-start">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="h-px w-8 bg-workbench-accent"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-workbench-accent uppercase">
          // 01. About Me
        </span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-display font-bold text-workbench-text">
        System architecture meets frontend precision.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Section Content -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col gap-6">
      <p class="text-lg text-workbench-muted font-body leading-relaxed">
        I am a full stack engineer with a background in computer science. I build backend services, APIs, databases, and modern web applications.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg text-workbench-muted font-body leading-relaxed">
        My focus is writing clean code, designing solid database schemas, and setting up containerized environments with Docker. I care about performance, maintainability, and building software that works reliably in production.
      </p>
      <p class="text-lg text-workbench-muted font-body leading-relaxed">
        Through <span class="text-workbench-text font-medium">Altera Deck</span>, I build standalone tools, test new technical ideas, and publish my projects.
      </p>
      
      <!-- Education Snapshot -->
      <div class="mt-8 p-6 border border-workbench-border bg-workbench-surface/50">
        <h3 class="font-mono text-sm tracking-widest text-workbench-text uppercase mb-4">Education</h3>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <li class="flex flex-col">
            <span class="text-workbench-text font-display font-medium text-lg">Bachelor of Computer Science</span>
            <span class="text-workbench-muted text-sm font-mono mt-1">University of Technology Yogyakarta | GPA: 3.69/4.00</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-col">
            <span class="text-workbench-text font-display font-medium text-lg">Full Stack Developer Bootcamp</span>
            <span class="text-workbench-muted text-sm font-mono mt-1">DumbWays Indonesia | Dec 2024 to Jul 2025</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</section>
